{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_008_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:9fa1df7b9afa8b2fe79ca85a96a8c84b05e61d4935f8effd7c7292795a3617a3",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_008_22:5_02_008_22_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ce7204daf7c6a77fc393b855a70d879d2528ce181fbb37feb0f9fa8741908e5",
      "text": "原来你在这啊，阁下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_008_22:5_02_008_22_a:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0d494e6925e115a7cbad9a3008063c93b2079787b522d8011fa836378030565",
      "text": "……其实，我想把情人节巧克力的\n回礼送给你。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_008_22:5_02_008_22_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5623be70f9d69874bf59853e89d7aecb1429f94b9bf5dea5726c18ad885fee69",
      "text": "还请务必收下。\n若是能合阁下的心意就好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_008_22:5_02_008_22_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d1774ed80c7841d7afb741bfdfad8535bf5977aaeb0ce688893ddfb6550c1812",
      "text": "情人节谢谢你。\n收到的巧克力，我细细品尝过了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_008_22:5_02_008_22_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec13d52db57ff0c4a5e438db9b26bbd6029cb8a34010629375c1cd33cb2494fd",
      "text": "为了回报阁下的这份关怀，\n我也会努力的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_008_22:5_02_008_22_b:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c94dad07353b4c1140d3a3dc339ea3e5ae1ea7264ddfb2b09753ea169d5ab1aa",
      "text": "在百忙之中，\n突然把你叫出来真是抱歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_008_22:5_02_008_22_b:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:949fa73b740128b9c98eef9630ae1c426d475c5c9f338ffa8fd10b9310090e44",
      "text": "我有样东西想交给阁下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_008_22:5_02_008_22_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51f35fa62be165a1f1cff78e992203ab527c29843c9b73650b8eabc2b4cff93c",
      "text": "……请收下这个。\n是白色情人节的回礼。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_008_22:5_02_008_22_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9a8de8a6f073a9c1d717a6240cad8a5e7c790ee2a10da08fca387456138626b2",
      "text": "若是能合你的心意就好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_008_22:5_02_008_22_b:cmd-000029:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ccb914c1968a0768da834c6b4ea69b7f2f0c765aaa81d4e6c64126d995d67f7f",
      "text": "非常感谢！我很高兴",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_008_22:5_02_008_22_b:cmd-000030:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c808a356827a37096a31ef9cbed9e92003a7ac4cd767f878f0e30586b4a2978b",
      "text": "我可以收下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_008_22:5_02_008_22_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:014ef45178564a3c21aa7477589336c914bd2a00a26e088fb50f129ebc32e095",
      "text": "看来你很喜欢，真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_008_22:5_02_008_22_b:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffa9e31e3c11db36100d89a13ffd6352816b619a8ad9a36663a81e84296b822d",
      "text": "那是自然。请务必收下。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_008_22:5_02_008_22_b:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:26ea1fe6a5ec804606ab8b8d9ef0b405681cb1ed1b3ce90aa9092a82b685754a",
      "text": "再次向你道谢，情人节送我的巧克力，\n非常美味。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_008_22:5_02_008_22_b:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62b2d1f07db8587d88fc8bd631985453addba14d140e9862f579e810250b3d06",
      "text": "那般美味的情人节巧克力，\n我还是第一次吃到。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_008_22:5_02_008_22_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b1ceabbcbf7aa117c183b323ba87cb1b274a08ae6aa06486f4ab2bdbfac983a",
      "text": "虽然不知是否符合阁下的喜好，\n但若是能哪怕稍微传达出我的心意，我也就心满意足了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
